<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of ecuadorean coffee, effective Sept 5 to 11:</p>
<p>	  Washed arabic....................$ 111.10</p>
<p>	  Natural arabic...................$ 104.39</p>
<p>	  Robust natural...................$  64.46</p>
<p>	  Roasted and/or ground............$ 100.47</p>
</text>
